  "name": "Meteorological Data from Station Duckjeokdo, South Korea in China Real Time Data Base (RTDB) for NEAR-GOOS",
  "description": "Meteorological data collected from Station Duckjeokdo, South Korea. Data can be downloaded from the China Real Time Data Base for NEAR-GOOS. First time users must register to gain database access.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: The National Marine Data and Information Service of China (NMDIS) has developed and maintained China Delayed Mode Data Base for NEAR-GOOS (CDMDB) to offer basic data service to NEAR-GOOS and GOOS communities.",
